5,0,1,talk,Rin,,Yay! A mystery game! I'm going to be the best detective ever and find the wolf! Is everyone ready? Let's go!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Victoria,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. I believe a quiet and observant start is the most rational approach for us.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with Victoria. Since we have no information yet, let's use this time to observe how everyone interacts.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Toshio,,A sensible start. I will be watching for any inconsistencies in behavior or sudden shifts in tone as we proceed.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,I'm quite interested to see who tries to lead the group first. I'll be observing from the sidelines for now.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, you're so quiet! Are you hiding a secret? Hehe, just kidding! I think we should all share our favorite colors to be friends!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"While that is a sweet suggestion, Rin, I believe we should remain focused on the objective of the game.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Victoria is right. Let's keep the conversation open, but let's be mindful of who is trying to steer the narrative too early.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Toshio,,I wonder if the Seer is already planning their first divination. It will be the most critical piece of evidence we have.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,Indeed. The Seer's safety is paramount. I suggest the Seer remains hidden until the information is truly necessary.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, you're so serious! But I'll be super careful too! I'll use my super-instincts to smell the wolf!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"Instincts can be deceptive, Rin. I prefer to analyze the gaps between what people say and how they act.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I'll be looking for contradictions. If someone's logic is too polished, it might be a mask.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Toshio,,I agree. A perfect facade is often the first sign of a hidden agenda.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,It seems we are all in agreement on the method. I'm curious to see whose mask slips first.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Rin,,I'm getting sleepy already! Goodnight everyone! I hope the Seer finds something super spooky tonight!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Victoria,,I wish you all a peaceful night. Let us hope for a safe morning.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Victoria,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,Let's conclude for today. We will have more concrete information tomorrow. Goodnight.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Toshio,,I shall retire now. I look forward to analyzing tomorrow's discourse.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Shion,,"A delightful start. Sleep well, everyone.","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
