36,1,1,talk,Rin,,Good morning! Did anyone have a dream about wolves? I'm ready to find the bad guy! Who's suspicious?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Victoria,,Good morning. I hope everyone slept well. I am wondering if the Seer has found any clues to guide us.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Since the first night has passed, the Seer now has information. I believe it is time to consider our first move.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"If the Seer is among us and feels it is safe, now would be the time to provide a lead.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Shion,,Or perhaps the Seer prefers to wait. A premature reveal is a death sentence in this game.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Mizuki, you're the leader! Do you know something? Tell us, tell us! Hehe!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"Rin, please do not pressure others. We must decide as a group how to handle the information.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"I will be honest. I am the Seer, and I have found the werewolf. It is Rin.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"That was a very bold and immediate reveal, Mizuki. Are you certain you want to expose yourself so early?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Shion,,"A very direct approach. However, we must consider if this is a genuine claim or a wolf's attempt to frame a child.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Rin,,"WHAT?! Me?! I'm not a wolf! I'm just Rin! Mizuki, why are you lying? That's so mean!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"This is a shocking development. @Mizuki, your confidence is striking, but we must verify this logically.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,My divination is absolute. Rin is the werewolf. I am revealing myself now because the village cannot afford a mistake.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"If Mizuki is the Seer, the game ends today. If she is the wolf, she has just secured a vote against Rin.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Shion,,"It is a high-stakes gamble. Rin's reaction is emotional, which is expected, but not proof of innocence.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'm not acting! I'm really sad that Mizuki said that! Please don't believe her! I'm a good girl!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"It is difficult to decide. However, Mizuki's willingness to sacrifice her safety suggests she is telling the truth.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I trust the logic of the group. The evidence is clear. I suggest we vote for Rin.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I find Mizuki's resolve convincing. I will follow the Seer's lead.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Shion,,I agree. The risk of keeping a known werewolf is higher than the risk of a fake Seer.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
